    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hitmen Havoc: A Wild Mix of Strategy and Chaos</h2><br><strong>Hitmen Havoc is a cartoony, fast-paced 2D arena party shooter where strategy meets mayhem. Whether you\u2019re battling friends, foes, strangers, or viewers, every match is a fresh and exciting challenge.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose from 8 unique characters, each with their own special skills and stats</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137300/extras/f20dc063b7004de13ec8c0ee5d47d7d9.poster.avif?t=1727440778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137300/extras/f20dc063b7004de13ec8c0ee5d47d7d9.webm?t=1727440778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137300/extras/f20dc063b7004de13ec8c0ee5d47d7d9.mp4?t=1727440778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Dive into customizable game modes that keep the action unpredictable and exhilarating. <br>Perfect for quick sessions or lively parties, Hitmen Havoc ensures unforgettable competitive fun with every round.<br><br>Diverse Weapon Arsenal: Arm yourself with a wide array of weapons, each adding a distinct flavor to the chaotic gameplay. From precision shots to explosive mayhem, there's a weapon for every scenario.<br>Dynamic Arenas: Battle across multiple levels, each offering a unique environment and challenges that keep you on your toes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137300/extras/91f38b4296d0758583ceb9921c1f47ac.poster.avif?t=1727440778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137300/extras/91f38b4296d0758583ceb9921c1f47ac.webm?t=1727440778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so